From freebsd-alpha  Thu Jul 20 19:02:56 2000
From: Matthew Jacob <mjacob () feral ! com>
Date: Thu, 20 Jul 2000 19:02:56 +0000
To: freebsd-alpha
Subject: more on- Re: fxp0 hangs on a PC164 using STABLE
